# One-off reports and session state. This repository is private, but the reason
# to ignore these is the files themselves: they carry real paths under ~/.trae-cn
# plus measured data volumes — they are working documents, never source.
# No leading slash: `reports/` matches at any depth, including docs/reports/.
reports/

